# Crystal Imperium balance test: Whitney (trainer 406) at the badge-2 level cap (21).
# Team: Pidgeotto / Quilava / Kadabra / Machop (Machop is kept for Miltank), no items, never
# switching voluntarily. Twelve battles with different RNG must include at least one win and
# at least two losses. This naive team wins about a quarter of the time (3/12 on 2026-10-24),
# so five samples were too few: they could all be losses without anything having changed.
!new_game()
!battle_style_set()
!give_mon(17, 21)
!give_mon(156, 21)
!give_mon(64, 21)
!give_mon(66, 21)
savestate team.ss
!battle_trainer(406)
wait 1100
expect16 {gBattleMons+136} 35 whitney_leads_clefairy
# Pidgeotto Gust, Quilava Flame Wheel, Kadabra Psybeam, Machop Low Sweep
!sample_battle(406, "0,2,3,0", runs=12, min_wins=1, max_wins=10)
